DESCRIPTION:From the team behind Pydantic\, Logfire is a new type of observ
 ability platform built on the same belief as our open source library — t
 hat the most powerful tools can be easy to use.\n\nIn this talk\, we'll in
 troduce Logfire\, then demonstrate how it can make understanding and fixin
 g your app faster and more enjoyable.\n\nWe'll touch on some of the most u
 seful integrations.
DTSTAMP:20261116T105842Z
LOCATION:Auditorium
SUMMARY:Pydantic Logfire — Uncomplicated Observability - Marcelo Trylesin
 ski\, Sydney Runkle
URL:https://pretalx.evolutio.pt/pycon-portugal-2024/talk/S3FCGA/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pretalx-pycon-portugal-2024-8V3PUH@pretalx.evolutio.pt
DTSTART;TZID=WET:20241017T170000
DTEND;TZID=WET:20241017T173000
DESCRIPTION:In the last year\, there were a lot of innovations in the ASGI 
 specification. A lot of extensions were introduced\, the wording on the sp
 ecification itself was clarified\, and some new things were included.\n\nI
 n this talk\, we're going to see the changes that were brought from the AS
 GI specification to Uvicorn\, and Starlette\, and how FastAPI benefits fro
 m them.\n\nAt the end of this talk\, the attendee will understand better t
 he ASGI specification\, and learn about new features that are not that vis
 ible in the ecosystem.
DTSTAMP:20261116T105842Z
LOCATION:Auditorium
SUMMARY:Unlocking ASGI Innovations: How FastAPI Reaps the Benefits - Marcel
 o Trylesinski
URL:https://pretalx.evolutio.pt/pycon-portugal-2024/talk/8V3PUH/
END:VEVENT
